= Reshape the leadership

Our advisers are the party's leadership in practice. Bringing someone in gives their faction strength; removing someone is a purge, and the faction they speak for will not forget it. We can have at most 3 advisers.

- #kpd_add_advisor
- #kpd_remove_advisor
- @root: Leave the leadership as it is.
- @easy_discard
